      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `6467198af786d422d57edef9bcd4cd81c206d4c0414ab0bcbe1fdf32b20cf067--2.-Victims-of-crime-states-and-territories-Tables-9-to-16-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2021\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 854b9721f2bf0c4f60b5865177705ae91cfa474ebf634ae09690453969155c78 | missing |\n| \"Table 9\" | 98a33cf7950e5f0a1e430167091516178e92838221955e71a78ab92989bf69c5 | missing |\n| \"Table 10\" | 936d73cd0ede36137fc61fcbf13dc13a52888061a68bdec3985f37c6aca8b20a | missing |\n| \"Table 11\" | a8b7554c8357314253f84abe52b604e7a065c3983d5e527d24e8dbd483381b06 | missing |\n| \"Table 12\" | 13540c38a59eccd3c3b2a2962c2cd01eb420507f542fe400aae1a9970a6537f7 | missing |\n| \"Table 13\" | e3600bcf5d66b40cec51119981e332d78b8228706d3364f5e8d6740b889094bf | missing |\n| \"Table 14\" | 9e91e91ff9b0138438e16400c4d1aaaab689fd0dabd0d25c66900f2f37cdeffe | missing |\n| \"Table 15\" | 7ce2a2e2b0963be709f7dd03c19bccb502ffe2dce59ff46f5368f38ec4af15ee | missing |\n| \"Table 16\" | fc8f39f4428dad421209bf9a04c5fbd35ce05ecf54ff1516c395ef34bd371137 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
